  [x] Give the admin the weekly table's editing affordances in ./view.py and the dialog context in ./routes.py and
    ../day_dialog/day_dialog.sdd: a clickable Lesson sub-row opening its edit dialog, and an empty add slot per week
    opening the add-Lesson form that re-renders the weekly table in place
  [x] Add @CourseRealizationRepository.list_for_course and @RealizationService.list_realizations_for_course, so
