  [x] Add @RealizationService.update_realization and @RealizationService.delete_realization, with the matching
    @CourseRealizationRepository operations, so ../courses/courses.sdd's page can edit and remove a realization
  [x] Add the admin `Edit` and `Delete` controls and their `<dialog>`s for each Lesson sub-row in ./view.py, and the
    guarded update and delete routes in ./routes.py writing through ../lessons/lessons.sdd's @LessonService
  [x] Show each Lesson sub-row's weekday, `d.m.` day and time range under its topic, instead of a time range alone
  [x] Render the per-Lesson `Edit` dialog's date through ../shared/shared.sdd's @day_calendar, a Monday-first month
    grid, instead of a browser date picker
  [x] Offer the per-Lesson `Edit` dialog's start and end times as prefilled ../day_dialog/day_dialog.sdd's
    @time_select dropdowns side by side on one row
  [x] Show each week's ../week_themes/week_themes.sdd theme in its `Week` cell on the week number's line, and give
    that cell the admin's own add and edit dialog plus delete confirmation in ./view.py
  [x] Add the guarded `/realizations/week-themes` create, update and delete routes in ./routes.py writing through
    ../week_themes/week_themes.sdd's @WeekThemeService
  [x] Add the rightmost `Deadline` column with each week's add dialog and the per-Deadline edit and delete
    dialogs in ./view.py, and the guarded `/realizations/deadlines` routes in ./routes.py writing through
    ../deadlines/deadlines.sdd's @DeadlineService
  [x] Show each Holiday sub-row's title over its own weekday and `d.m.` day in red italics, like a Lesson's two
    lines, instead of a one-line `Holiday \u2013 title`, carrying that day on @WeekEntry's `entry_date`
  [x] Give every sub-row of a NoTeachWeek's week the wall planner's mild red background tint in ./view.py, for
    visitors and the admin alike
  [x] Show each ../conferences/conferences.sdd Conference as a purple sub-row in the `Lessons` column, laid out like a
